  "name": "Venison Stroganoff",
  "subtitle": "Tender venison in a creamy mushroom sauce with egg noodles",
  "description": "Brown seasoned venison, slow-cook it in mushroom sauce, and finish with tender egg noodles for a hearty four-serving meal.",
